  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The patient's lists and general practitioner now match what DDS sends.\n\t\t  - Every List declares the event-date order exactly where DDS does: in orderedBy on Active Allergies and Miscellaneous record, and as a second coding in the list's code on Problems and Medication List.\n\t\t  - The entries of every List are kept in that order: newest day first by onset for Problems and Active Allergies, by dateAsserted for Medication List and by effective date for Miscellaneous record. Entries sharing a day keep the order the mart gave them, and undated entries come last.\n\t\t  - The list-order code is sent as event-date. DDS sends it with a leading space on two lists, which is not a valid code.\n\t\t  - Patient.generalPractitioner now references the patient's usual GP as a Practitioner, from usual_gp_practitioner_id, instead of the practice's ODS code. A patient with no usual GP has no generalPractitioner, as in DDS.",
